1
00:00:00,974 --> 00:00:02,764
(Penny:)- Hold.
RAJESH: Who made Sheldon the boss?

2
00:00:02,934 --> 00:00:06,524
(Sheldon:)I believe I'm hearing some negativity
on the factory floor.

3
00:00:08,732 --> 00:00:11,902
- So?
- The labor force is a living organism...

4
00:00:12,068 --> 00:00:13,238
...that must be nurtured.

5
00:00:13,403 --> 00:00:16,363
(Sheldon:)Any counterproductive grumbling
must be skillfully headed off...

6
00:00:16,531 --> 00:00:19,821
(Sheldon:)...by management. Observe. Hey!

7
00:00:19,993 --> 00:00:22,073
(Sheldon:)Less talk, more work.

8
00:00:24,789 --> 00:00:26,669
- Nicely done.
- Thank you.

9
00:00:26,833 --> 00:00:30,003
(Sheldon:)You hear any union talk,
you let me know.

10
00:00:32,047 --> 00:00:35,427
[SINGING WHILE YAWNING]
Someone's in the kitchen with Dinah

11
00:00:36,259 --> 00:00:37,679
[WHISPERING]

12
00:00:37,844 --> 00:00:40,304
[SINGING]
Someone's in the kitchen I know

13
00:00:40,472 --> 00:00:42,432
Ho, ho, ho

14
00:00:43,683 --> 00:00:46,683
[SINGING]
Someone's in the kitchen with Dinah

15
00:00:47,479 --> 00:00:48,609
Sheldon. Sheldon.

16
00:00:48,772 --> 00:00:50,352
[SINGING]
'Cause I sold my soul

17
00:00:50,523 --> 00:00:52,903
(Sheldon(waking up, singing):)To the company store

18
00:00:56,279 --> 00:00:59,029
- Honey, do you want some coffee?
- No, I don't drink coffee.

